    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You know how to take advantage of slow-moving enemies in combat.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +1</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you make a successful attack against an enemy who has not yet acted in combat, you add your full Heroic Level to damage rolls.</p><p><b>Normal:</b> Typically you add only one-half your Heroic Level to damage rolls.</p>",
